  translation {
    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n3:54 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n6:09 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n8:09 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n10:09 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n4:45 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n7:00 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n9:00 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n11:00 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station"
